config VIDEO_RPI_OV2311
	tristate "OmniVision OV2311 sensor support (Raspberry Pi driver)"
	depends on I2C && VIDEO_DEV
	depends on MEDIA_CAMERA_SUPPORT
	select MEDIA_CONTROLLER
	select VIDEO_V4L2_SUBDEV_API
	select V4L2_FWNODE
	help
	  Raspberry Pi's driver for the OmniVision OV2311 1600x1300 global
	  shutter monochrome sensor (2 MIPI CSI-2 lanes), with the bus
	  configuration and frame interval calls the Rockchip CSI-2 D-PHY and
	  ISP drivers need.

	  The module is called rpi_ov2311.

